复生命，并解除负面效果。","levels":[1,5],"damage":[185.0,285.0],"cooldown":[9.0,9.0],"ailment":"重伤"}}],"number":1},{"code":"cwp_plitvice2","name":"光环","type":"单手剑","variants":[{"id":9010564,"code":"cwp_plitvice2_epic","label":"普通","stars":5,"sprite":{"sheet":"items","name":"cwp_plitvice2"},"stats":[{"name":"每秒伤害","values":[606,665],"baseValues":[605.7270000000001,665.1120000000001],"grows":true},{"name":"火属性攻击","values":[189,207],"baseValues":[188.70000000000002,207.20000000000002],"grows":true},{"name":"暴击率","values":[7,7],"unit":"%"}],"growthRate":1.02,"mainOptions":[{"name":"防御","min":5.0,"max":12.0,"unit":"%"},{"name":"生命","min":5.0,"max":12.0,"unit":"%"},{"name":"武器技能恢复速度","min":4.0,"max":8.0,"unit":"%"}],"subOptions":[{"name":"技能伤害值","min":5.0,"max":14.0,"unit":"%"}],"subCount":[0,1],"limitBreak":[{"name":"暴击率","min":10,"max":10,"unit":"%"}],"engrave":[{"name":"攻击","min":15.0,"max":15.0,"unit":"%"},{"name":"生命","min":15.0,"max":15.0,"unit":"%"}],"engraveRandom":[{"name":"攻击","unit":"%","values":[3.0,6.0,9.0,12.0,15.0]}],"effects":[{"name":"专属效果","description":"佩戴武器时，英雄的职业技能随着武器而变。\n- 按照暴击率超出数值的3倍，提升暴击伤害倍数；\n- 队伍能力切换为[c][F8E8CB]暴击伤害倍数[-][/c]；\n- 普通攻击切换为[c][F8E8CB]蔓延火焰[-][/c]；\n- 连锁技能切换为[c][F8E8CB]宣判[-][/c]；\n- 特殊能力切换为[c][F8E8CB]余烬[-][/c]。"}],"skill":{"name":"忏悔火焰","description":"捆绑敌人，对其造成远程伤害并附带击倒效果。","levels":[1,5],"damage":[165.0,285.0],"cooldown":[10.3,8.3],"ailment":"击倒"}}],"number":2}],"profile":{"Age":null,"Height":[164],"Weight":[46]},"tribes":["神灵"],"story":"普利特维采，战争女神。\n  \n具有随意控制火焰的能力，神界力量源泉世界树被烧之后，丧失神力，无法完全发挥实力。虽实力不足，也想保持神之威严，平时严于律己，处事谨慎。但是，频繁露出马脚，经常因情绪激动而进退失据，破绽百出的呆萌女神。\n  \n被封印时答应，只要有资格的勇士访问浮游城，就会出手相助。未被封印的500年前，与勇士们一起踏上了远征之路，却在征途中多次经历失去亲人的痛苦，开始畏惧孤独寂寞。曾是自己手下部将的天使安吉是普利特维采最信任的人，如今下落不明。普利特维采身边出现新伙伴，值得欣慰，但又怕失去这名新伙伴而令人忧虑。偶尔陷入沉思，像是在回顾过去。","storyKey":"profile_plitvice_story","sources":{"hero":"heroes.json / OriginId=110","profile":"heroprofile.json / OriginId=110","strings":"strings-zhCN.json","items":"items.json / TargetCharacterIds, ExclusiveCharacterId","voiceLines":["strings-zhCN.json / Voice_*, cv_*","strings-enUS.json / Voice_*, cv_*","strings-jaJP.json / Voice_*, cv_*"],"voiceAudio":"gtaudio/data/offline-package.json; CharacterVoiceType; heroes.json VoiceId"},"voiceLines":[{"id":"plitvice","label":"普通","lines":[{"type":"NormalBattleWin","label":"胜利-普通战斗","texts":{"zhCN":["朋友，看到了吗？这些对我来说没什么。"],"enUS":["Witness me. Enjoy my victory."],"jaJP":["見ておったか？この程度わしにとっては造作も無いわ"]},"keys":["cv_plitvice_NormalBattleWin"],"audio":{"zhCN":["offline/AssetBundles/Android/ondemand/voices_cn/110/1100001@-1947672906792770138"],"enUS":["cdn/Android/ondemand/voices_en/110/1100001"],"jaJP":["offline/AssetBundles/Android/ondemand/voices_ja/110/1100001@-6537226359672035197"]},"audioName":"1100001"},{"type":"BossBattleWin","label":"胜利-首领战斗","texts":{"zhCN":["与强敌较量，取得胜利！没有比这更好的贡品了。"],"enUS":["A worthy foe and victory! There is no better offering."],"jaJP":["よくぞ強敵との死闘を制した！うむ、よくやったぞ"]},"keys":["cv_plitvice_BossBattleWin"],"audio":{"zhCN":["offline/AssetBundles/Android/ondemand/voices_cn/110/1100002@3522705653964990790"],"enUS":["cdn/Android/ondemand/voices_en/110/1100002"],"jaJP":["offline/AssetBundles/Android/ondemand/voices_ja/110/1100002@-3408826661988471521"]},"audioName":"1100002"},{"type":"Die","label":"阵亡","texts":{"zhCN":["唉，真扫兴…"],"enUS":["I became… Bored."],"jaJP":["ふん、白けるのう…"]},"keys":["cv_plitvice_Die"],"audio":{"zhCN":["offline/AssetBundles/Android/ondemand/voices_cn/110/1100003@-7472279361046504628"],"enUS":["cdn/Android/ondemand/voices_en/110/1100003"],"jaJP":["offline/AssetBundles/Android/ondemand/voices_ja/110/1100003@3779883966196070586"]},"audioName":"1100003"},{"type":"GetExp","label":"获得经验结晶","texts":{"zhCN":["哇呜，是贡品！"],"enUS":["A worthy offering!"],"jaJP":["うむ、貢ぎ物じゃな！"]},"keys":["cv_plitvice_GetExp"],"audio":{"zhCN":["offline/AssetBundles/Android/ondemand/voices_cn/110/1100004@-45894047820730113"],"enUS":["cdn/Android/ondemand/voices_en/110/1100004"],"jaJP":["offline/AssetBundles/Android/ondemand/voices_ja/110/1100004@2119336457342665047"]},"audioName":"1100004"},{"type":"LevelUp","label":"升级","texts":{"zhCN":["感觉好多了。"],"enUS":["Mine own power is coming back."],"jaJP":["少しばかり力を取り戻した気がするのう！"]},"keys":["cv_plitvice_LevelUp"],"audio":{"zhCN":["offline/AssetBundles/Android/ondemand/voices_cn/110/1100005@4575005889841449768"],"enUS":["cdn/Android/ondemand/voices_en/110/1100005"],"jaJP":["offline/AssetBundles/Android/ondemand/voices_ja/110/1100005@-1303070209736279854"]},"audioName":"1100005"},{"type":"EquipWeapon","label":"佩戴装备","texts":{"zhCN":["很好，我会把这件事当成永恒的佳话。"],"enUS":["Good. Thy name shall be known forever."],"jaJP":["褒めてつかわす、後生まで語り継がせよう"]},"keys":["cv_plitvice_EquipWeapon"],"audio":{"zhCN":["offline/AssetBundles/Android/ondemand/voices_cn/110/1100006@-8710731656291613815"],"enUS":["cdn/Android/ondemand/voices_en/110/1100006"],"jaJP":["offline/AssetBundles/Android/ondemand/voices_ja/110/1100006@-6467836155401819221"]},"audioName":"1100006"},{"type":"EquipCostume","label":"穿戴时装","texts":{"zhCN":["哇，这件衣服好漂亮！嗯，嗯…我是说人类总能做出稀奇的物品！"],"enUS":["Oh, this is simply delightful! I meant, humans sure make curious garments!"],"jaJP":["おおお、可愛いのじゃ！こほん！ヒトは面白きものを作るのう"]},"keys":["cv_plitvice_EquipCostume"],"audio":{"zhCN":["offline/AssetBundles/Android/ondemand/voices_cn/110/1100007@-1747084809301421928"],"enUS":["cdn/Android/ondemand/voices_en/110/1100007"],"jaJP":["offline/AssetBundles/Android/ondemand/voices_ja/110/1100007@-7084227410452057635"]},"audioName":"1100007"},{"type":"Evolve","label":"进化","texts":{"zhCN":["呵呵，和我原来的形态更接近了。"],"enUS":["I've come one step closer to mine own original form!"],"jaJP":["ふふん、わしの本来の姿にまた一歩近づいたのじゃ！"]},"keys":["cv_plitvice_Evolve"],"audio":{"zhCN":["offline/AssetBundles/Android/ondemand/voices_cn/110/1100008@-8248278663778227177"],"enUS":["cdn/Android/ondemand/voices_en/110/1100008"],"jaJP":["offline/AssetBundles/Android/ondemand/voices_ja/110/1100008@-3159402196813698233"]},"audioName":"1100008"},{"type":"Attack1","label":"攻击1","texts":{"zhCN":["嗯！"],"enUS":["Haa!"],"jaJP":